# Epic Shared Trigger

When the user shares an Epic key, an Epic URL, or refers to an Epic and asks for an implementation plan, milestone breakdown, phase plan, delivery roadmap, or any equivalent:

1. Always read and follow `.cursor/skills/epic-implementation-planner/SKILL.md`.
2. Do not skip this skill, even if the request feels small.
3. Do not draft phases or write any markdown plan without going through the skill.

The skill ensures the Epic is read via the `<TICKETING_MCP>`, gaps are surfaced as focused questions, the Epic is updated append-only, and the Implementation Plan markdown is created in the correct location.

Pair this rule with `.cursor/rules/process/source-of-truth.mdc`.
